{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cam_zm_q1q2",
  "description": "Stage-2 implementation of the CAM Zhang-McFarlane deep-convection temperature and moisture tendencies q1q2_pjr (stage 2 of the EqESM project; instrumented cam6_4_212 fork of the SCAM ARM97_4scam run, dump window steps 18-23 and 40-48): the pointwise laws of zm_convr.F90:2584-2622 evaluated on the dumped convr state (the q1q2_pjr call of zm_convr.F90:718-724, inside the gathered-column loop; all dumped columns of the window are g = 1, jt = 15, maxg = 32 = pver). The tendencies: emc = -cme (the net condensation cu - evp of cldprp, F90:2586-2587), dqdt = emc + div(mu(qu - qhat) + md(qd - qhat))/dp (F90:2596-2601), dsdt = -rl/cp emc + div(mu(su - shat) + md(sd - shat))/dp (F90:2589-2594), and dl = du qcde(k+1) (F90:2603-2604) over the convection layer k = jt..pver-1, with the subcloud replacement at k = maxg: (1/dsubcld)(-mu(qu - qhat) - md(qd - qhat)) and the temperature analogue (F90:2611-2619), and the copy-down dqdt(k) = dqdt(k-1), dsdt(k) = dsdt(k-1) for k > maxg (F90:2620-2622). The flux divergence of each tendency is one application of the shared template zm_flux_divergence (cam_templates.esm, (F[min(k+1, PVER)] - F[k])/dp[k] of the layer-centered plume flux F = zm_flux = mu (x - xhat) + md (x - xhat), itself two applications of zm_mass_flux_excess) and the subcloud tendency is one application of zm_subcloud_tendency (-F[k]/dsubcld), both invoked once for q and once for s; the k+1 gather is clamped to min(k+1, PVER) and the piecewise mask (ifelse on the level index k against the scalar parameters jt and maxg) selects the flux form for jt <= k < maxg, the subcloud value (gathered at index maxg) for k >= maxg, and zero above jt; the masked branches of the dumped column are all zero anyway (mu = 0 above jt on the dump, so the flux form vanishes there; the copy-down never fires because maxg = pver on every dumped column). Levels are the CAM convention, lev 1 = model top, lev 32 = surface, exactly as dumped (no reversal). The dumped cme/mu/md/du/qu/su/qd/sd/qhat/shat/qcde/pdel enter as parameters; dqdt/dsdt/dlf are unknowns pinned against the dump rows. Tests at steps 18, 40 and 48 pin the tendencies at the convection top (lev 15 = jt), the downdraft region (lev 17), a deep level (lev 25) and the subcloud level (lev 32), and dl at the two detraining levels 15-16 where du > 0.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": [
   "eqesm:stage2",
   "model:convection",
   "cam:zm"
  ],
  "references": [
   {
    "citation": "CAM6.4 (cam6_4_212, Zhang-McFarlane deep convection), components/cam/src/atmos_phys/schemes/zhang_mcfarlane/zm_convr.F90, subroutine q1q2_pjr (F90:2520-2628), called from zm_convr_run at F90:718-724."
   }
  ]
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "PVER": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 32,
   "description": "Number of model levels (pver = 32 in the SCAM run; the dump's pver)."
  }
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "lev": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "PVER"
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "ZMq1q2": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./cam_templates.esm"
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "cme": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "kg/(kg*s)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Net condensation rate of cldprp, cme = cu - evp (the dumped cmeg column; the q1q2_pjr emc = -cu + evp of zm_convr.F90:2586-2587), [kg/kg/s]"
    },
    "mu": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "hPa/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Updraft mass flux after the mb scaling of zm_convr.F90:702-704, [hPa/s] (mb = hPa); dump column mu"
    },
    "md": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "hPa/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Downdraft mass flux after the mb scaling, [hPa/s] (mb = hPa); dump column md"
    },
    "du": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "1/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Updraft detrainment, dumped in its final 1/s units (the mu-continuity identity of the stage-1 validator, mu(k) - mu(k+1) = (eu(k) - du(k)) dp(k) with dp in mb, holds with eu/du in 1/s); the dl = du qcde(k+1) law of F90:2603 then has mixing-ratio tendency units; dump column du"
    },
    "qu": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Updraft specific humidity, [kg/kg]; dump column qu"
    },
    "su": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "K",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Updraft dry static energy, [K]; dump column su"
    },
    "qd": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Downdraft specific humidity, [kg/kg]; dump column qd"
    },
    "sd": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "K",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Downdraft dry static energy, [K]; dump column sd"
    },
    "qhat": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Environmental specific humidity of the plume-mixing state, [kg/kg]; dump column qhat"
    },
    "shat": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "K",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Environmental dry static energy of the plume-mixing state, [K]; dump column shat"
    },
    "qcde": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Detrained condensate qldeg, the ql argument of q1q2_pjr (zm_convr.F90:723), [kg/kg]; dump column qcde"
    },
    "pdel": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "Pa",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Layer pressure thickness, [Pa]; dump column pdel; the q1q2 pressure measure dp = 0.01 pdel in mb (zm_convr.F90:717)"
    },
    "jt": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 15,
     "description": "Top level index of the convection layer jt (the ktm of the single-column gathered loop; zm_convr.F90:2583), = 15 on all dumped columns; dump column jt"
    },
    "maxg": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 32,
     "description": "Subcloud top level index maxg (the kbm of the single-column loop, zm_convr.F90:2607), = 32 = pver on all dumped columns so the k > maxg copy-down of F90:2620-2622 never fires in this window; dump column maxg"
    },
    "dsubcld": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "hPa",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Subcloud-layer pressure thickness dsubcld = sum of dp over the subcloud layers (zm_convr.F90:600), [hPa] (mb = hPa); dump column dsubcld"
    },
    "rl": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/kg",
     "default": 2501000.0,
     "description": "Latent heat of vaporization rl = SHR_CONST_LATVAP (shr_const_mod.F90:31), [J/kg]; dump constant rl"
    },
    "cpres": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/(kg*K)",
     "default": 1004.64,
     "description": "Dry-air heat capacity cp = SHR_CONST_CPDAIR (shr_const_mod.F90:36), [J/(kg*K)]; dump constant cpres"
    },
    "dp": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "hPa",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Layer pressure thickness in mb (hPa), dp = 0.01 pdel (zm_convr.F90:717), the denominator of the flux-divergence terms, [hPa]"
    },
    "emc": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "kg/(kg*s)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Net condensation emc = -cu + evp = -cme (zm_convr.F90:2586-2587), [kg/kg/s]"
    },
    "fd_q": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "kg/(kg*s)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Moisture flux divergence of the q1q2 dqdt law (zm_convr.F90:2596-2601), one application of the zm_flux_divergence template for the q species, (F[min(k+1, PVER)] - F[k])/dp[k] with F = zm_flux(mu, qu, md, qd, qhat), [kg/kg/s]"
    },
    "fd_s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "K/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Dry static energy flux divergence of the q1q2 dsdt law (zm_convr.F90:2589-2594), one application of the zm_flux_divergence template for the s species, (F[min(k+1, PVER)] - F[k])/dp[k] with F = zm_flux(mu, su, md, sd, shat), [K/s]"
    },
    "sub_dqdt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "kg/(kg*s)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Subcloud moisture tendency of zm_convr.F90:2616-2619, one application of the zm_subcloud_tendency template for the q species, (1/dsubcld)(-F[k]) with F = zm_flux(mu, qu, md, qd, qhat), evaluated on every level and gathered at index maxg by the dqdt mask, [kg/kg/s]"
    },
    "sub_dsdt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "K/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Subcloud temperature tendency of zm_convr.F90:2612-2615, one application of the zm_subcloud_tendency template for the s species, (1/dsubcld)(-F[k]) with F = zm_flux(mu, su, md, sd, shat), gathered at index maxg by the dsdt mask, [K/s]"
    },
    "dqdt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "kg/(kg*s)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Moisture tendency: emc + fd_q for jt <= k < maxg, sub_dqdt(maxg) for k >= maxg, 0 above jt (zm_convr.F90:2596-2601, 2616-2622), [kg/kg/s]; dump column dqdt"
    },
    "dsdt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "K/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Temperature tendency: -rl/cp emc + fd_s for jt <= k < maxg, sub_dsdt(maxg) for k >= maxg, 0 above jt (zm_convr.F90:2589-2594, 2612-2622), [K/s]; dump column dsdt"
    },
    "dlf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "units": "kg/(kg*s)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Detrained condensate tendency dl = du qcde(k+1) for jt <= k <= pver-1, 0 elsewhere (zm_convr.F90:2603-2604; the k = pver value is out of the Fortran loop and pinned to 0), [kg/kg/s]; dump column dlf"
    }
   },
